      "starter": "function factorial(n) {\n  \n}",
      "tests": [
        {
          "call": "factorial(0)",
          "expected": "1"
        },
        {
          "call": "factorial(5)",
          "expected": "120"
        },
        {
          "call": "factorial(1)",
          "expected": "1"
        }
      ],
      "rules": [],
      "solution": "function factorial(n) {\n  return n <= 1 ? 1 : n * factorial(n - 1);\n}",
      "explanation": "Рекурсия: n! = n × (n − 1)!."
